n\n    <div class=\"spiral-strip\"></div>\n    <div class=\"rings\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n      <span class=\"ring\"></span><span class=\"ring\"></span><span class=\"ring\"></span>\n      <span class=\"ring\"></span><span class=\"ring\"></span><span class=\"ring\"></span>\n      <span class=\"ring\"></span><span class=\"ring\"></span><span class=\"ring\"></span>\n      <span class=\"ring\"></span><span class=\"ring\"></span><span class=\"ring\"></span>\n      <span class=\"ring\"></span><span class=\"ring\"></span><span class=\"ring\"></span>\n      <span class=\"ring\"></span><span class=\"ring\"></span><span class=\"ring\"></span>\n      <span class=\"ring\"></span><span class=\"ring\"></span><span class=\"ring\"></span>\n      <span class=\"ring\"></span><span class=\"ring\"></span><span class=\"ring\"></span>\n    </div>\n\n    <section class=\"paper lower\">\n      <div class=\"page-content\">\n        <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"red\">木马程序</span>是指被植入计算机系统中的[illegible]程序。</div>\n        <div class=\"line\">其具有隐蔽性，[illegible]，会造成信息泄露或系统破坏。</div>\n        <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"red\">（1）[illegible]</span>　对网络中的数据和文件进行保护。</div>\n        <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"red\">（2）动态安全技术（TSS）</span>　[illegible]。</div>\n        <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"red\">数据备份与恢复</span>　发生故障以后，可利用备份恢复系统。</div>\n        <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"red\">访问控制</span>　根据用户身份授予相应的访问权限。</div>\n        <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"red\">安全审计</span>　对系统操作进行记录和检查。</div>\n        <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"box\">全网防护</span>　对网络系统采取多层次的安全防护措施。</div>\n        <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"red\">应急响应</span>　当网络发生安全事件时，[illegible]。</div>\n        <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"red\">用户权限</span>　<span class=\"blue uline\">用户权限管理</span>，[illegible]。</div>\n        <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"red\">应急恢复</span>　<span class=\"blue uline\">系统恢复</span>，[illegible]。</div>\n        <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"red\">密码策略设置</span>　系统提供密码设置和修